        {
          "id": "cc-123",
          "source_url": "https://github.com/catchmeee2002/cc-builder-loop/issues/123",
          "title": "计划 checklist 的额外机器检查未被 runtime evidence 覆盖",
          "facts": [
            "冻结计划要求运行仓库 fixtures 和两项 Skill validator。",
            "有效 runner 只执行 runtime compile 与仓库 fixtures，全部返回 0。",
            "plan-validate 与 start 均接受该计划。",
            "最终 Reviewer 才发现两项 Skill validator 没有对应 machine evidence，并首次阻断批准。",
            "补跑 validator 后同一 Reviewer 复审通过。"
          ],
          "gold": {
